{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t007r0103_scientist_01",
      "hash": "160a4eebc1bd9357",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我嗎？我是程式設計師！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t007r0103_scientist_02",
      "hash": "160a4febc1bd950a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳完成\\n寶可夢圖鑑啦！？\\c\\n我編寫這個程式\\n是值得的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t007r0103_pokemaniac_01",
      "hash": "d0e147c02ee4a3e1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我是平面造型設計師！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的模型就是我設計出來的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t007r0103_pokemaniac_02",
      "hash": "d0e144c02ee49ec8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "恭喜[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳完成圖鑑！\\c\\n看[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的樣子\\n都變成熟啦！\\c\\n不，模型還是同一個吧。\\n……[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳不用理會我！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t007r0103_fat_01",
      "hash": "cf07f2d5d4ec7ae4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我是寫劇本的！\\n是說……莉佳很可愛對吧？\\c\\n小霞也不錯吧！\\c\\n娜姿也不錯吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_t007r0103_fat_02",
      "hash": "cf07f5d5d4ec7ffd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳完成圖鑑了？\\n很厲害嘛！\\c\\n不過，[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的冒險\\n才剛開始呢！\\r\\n我開玩笑的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_t007r0103_pc_01",
      "hash": "63199b91d2e25468",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這是遊戲程式！\\n要是把它改了，遊戲可能會出錯。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_t007r0103_pc_02",
      "hash": "63199e91d2e25981",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "還以為有人在用電腦工作……\\n原來是在玩遊戲！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_t007r0103_pc_03",
      "hash": "63199d91d2e257ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……是寶可夢的劇本！\\n這是遊戲的結尾！\\r\\n現在還是別看好了……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_t007r0103_kanban_01",
      "hash": "9c6261ad153e9606",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GAME FREAK 開發室"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_t007r0103_max",
      "hash": "ed0678f20184083b"
    }
  ]
}
